 r←Test_01_Create base_url;D;check_cols;cid;column;data;event;event_type;h;name;organisation;payload;person;presentation;presentation_media;presentation_type;presentation_video;presenter;res;table;tid;youtube_video
⍝ Test that POST /crud/{table} creates a new record in the specified table and returns the created record with its new ID

 data←##.GenerateTestData 10
 (event_type event organisation person presentation_type presentation youtube_video presenter presentation_video presentation_media)←data

 D←#.DCMS

 r←1
 :For table :In event_type event organisation person presentation_type presentation youtube_video presenter presentation_video presentation_media
     name←⍕table
     {}D.SQL.Do'DELETE from ',name
     {}D.SQL.Do'ALTER TABLE ',name,' AUTO_INCREMENT = 1'
     tid←D.GLOBAL.tables⍳⊂name
     cid←(column←tid⊃D.GLOBAL.columns)⍳table.⎕NL ¯2
     payload←Table2JSON(table.⎕NL ¯2)⍪⍉↑table ⎕VGET check_cols←table.⎕NL ¯2
     h←⎕NEW #.HttpCommand'POST'
     h.URL←base_url,'/crud/',name
     'x-api-key'h.SetHeader #.DCMS.GLOBAL.secrets.upload_token
     h.ContentType←'application/json'
     h.Params←payload
     h.TranslateData←1
     res←h.Run
     :If 201≢res.HttpStatus
     :OrIf (res.Data ⎕VGET check_cols)≢payload ⎕VGET check_cols
         ⎕←'**     FAILED ',name
         r←0
         :Return
     :EndIf
 :EndFor
